    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Raphael Musyoka is a tough man to track down. He is not only busy, but also very reserved. The 63-year-old does not like the limelight and avoids being put on the spot. However, he has a remarkable story that needs to be told. Raphael is 63 years old and still wanted to get a degree...why? He graduated with a Bachelor of Science degree in Nursing in 2019. AKU's Martie Mtange caught up with him and shares his story.",
